<title>USA: Universal Auto share drop not due to operations.</title>
<headline>Universal Auto share drop not due to operations.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Universal Automotive Industries Inc said the recent decline in its stock price is not due to any changes in the company's operations or financial prospects.</p>
<p>Universal Automotive, which distributes auto parts, said it continues operating in its normal course.</p>
<p>The company's stock dropped 1-5/8 to 6 by mid-afternoon on the Nasdaq National Market.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
